+# Historical decision context
+
+Backtests use simulated UTC time and closed historical candles. Quantitative
+feeds and OI, net-flow, and price rankings currently have no point-in-time
+history adapter. The historical runner therefore omits all four current feeds,
+even when a saved strategy enables them. Loading today's observations into past
+decisions would introduce look-ahead bias. The shared decision path also skips
+current OI lookups and refuses missing historical candle snapshots instead of
+falling back to a current market fetch. Disable those options in simulation
+strategies so their configuration reflects the available inputs.
+
+Position age uses the simulated cutoff and the position's stored opening time.
+The optional `Context.SimulationTimeMS` field is populated only by backtests;
+other callers retain the existing wall-clock behavior.
+
+Regression checks:
+
+```sh
+go test -race ./backtest ./kernel -run 'TestHistorical(Context|PositionAge|Clock|Decision)' -count=1
+```
